  "title": "Toncoin (TON) Is Rebranding to Gram (GRAM): Migration Details for Mudrex Users",
  "summary": "Mudrex will support the Toncoin (TON) rebranding to Gram (GRAM) and the associated token migration. As part of this transition, all eligible TON holdings on Mudrex will be automatically converted to GRAM at a fixed ratio of 1 TON = 1 GRAM. Users do not need to take any action to participate in the migration. […]",
